%% User Actions and Workflows
%% Story: PAY-005 - Build Subscription Management UI Components
%% Describes key user workflows in subscription management

graph TD
    Start([User Opens<br/>Subscription Manager])

    %% Main Navigation
    Start --> ViewMode{View Mode}
    ViewMode -->|Creator| CreatorFlow[Creator Dashboard]
    ViewMode -->|User/Supporter| UserFlow[User Dashboard]

    %% Creator Flow
    CreatorFlow --> CreatorTabs{Select Tab}
    CreatorTabs -->|Tiers| ManageTiers[View Subscription Tiers]
    CreatorTabs -->|Subscribers| ViewSubscribers[View Subscribers List]

    ManageTiers --> CreateTier{Action}
    CreateTier -->|Create New| OpenDialog[Open Tier Dialog]
    CreateTier -->|Edit Existing| OpenDialog
    CreateTier -->|Toggle Active| UpdateTier[Update Tier Status]
    CreateTier -->|Delete| ConfirmDelete{Confirm?}

    OpenDialog --> FillForm[Fill Tier Details:<br/>Name, Price, Features,<br/>Billing Period]
    FillForm --> SaveTier[Save Tier]
    SaveTier --> RefreshTiers[Refresh Tier List]

    ConfirmDelete -->|Yes| DeleteTier[Delete Tier]
    ConfirmDelete -->|No| ManageTiers
    DeleteTier --> RefreshTiers

    ViewSubscribers --> SubscriberAction{Action}
    SubscriberAction -->|View Details| ShowDetails[Show Subscriber Details]
    SubscriberAction -->|Pause| PauseSub[Update Status to Paused]
    SubscriberAction -->|Activate| ActivateSub[Update Status to Active]

    %% User Flow
    UserFlow --> UserTabs{Select Tab}
    UserTabs -->|Active| ActiveSubs[View Active Subscriptions]
    UserTabs -->|Renewal| RenewalSettings[Manage Renewal Settings]
    UserTabs -->|Payment| PaymentMethods[Manage Payment Methods]
    UserTabs -->|History| ViewHistory[View Subscription History]

    ActiveSubs --> SubAction{Action}
    SubAction -->|View| ViewSubDetails[View Subscription Details]
    SubAction -->|Pause| PauseSubscription[Pause Subscription]
    SubAction -->|Resume| ResumeSubscription[Resume Subscription]
    SubAction -->|Cancel| CancelConfirm{Confirm Cancel?}
    SubAction -->|Toggle Auto-Renew| ToggleAuto[Update Auto-Renewal Setting]

    CancelConfirm -->|Yes| CancelSub[Cancel Subscription]
    CancelConfirm -->|No| ActiveSubs
    CancelSub --> RefreshSubs[Refresh Subscription List]

    PauseSubscription --> RefreshSubs
    ResumeSubscription --> RefreshSubs
    ToggleAuto --> RefreshSubs

    RenewalSettings --> ConfigRenewal[Configure:<br/>Auto-renewal,<br/>Notifications,<br/>Failure Handling]
    ConfigRenewal --> SaveSettings[Save Settings]
    SaveSettings --> RefreshSubs

    PaymentMethods --> PaymentAction{Action}
    PaymentAction -->|Add New| AddMethod[Add Payment Method:<br/>Lightning/Bitcoin/NOSTR]
    PaymentAction -->|Edit| EditMethod[Update Method Details]
    PaymentAction -->|Delete| DeleteMethod[Remove Payment Method]
    PaymentAction -->|Set Default| SetDefault[Set as Default Method]

    AddMethod --> RefreshMethods[Refresh Payment Methods]
    EditMethod --> RefreshMethods
    DeleteMethod --> RefreshMethods
    SetDefault --> RefreshMethods

    ViewHistory --> ExportHistory{Export?}
    ExportHistory -->|Yes| DownloadCSV[Download CSV File]
    ExportHistory -->|No| ViewHistory

    %% Styling
    style Start fill:#e3f2fd
    style CreatorFlow fill:#fff3e0
    style UserFlow fill:#f3e5f5
    style RefreshTiers fill:#c8e6c9
    style RefreshSubs fill:#c8e6c9
    style RefreshMethods fill:#c8e6c9
